如嚼蜡，惟诗直恐死方休。\n四时风月元无尽，万里江山更拟游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4825,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂书四首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"一身顶踵无非病，两饭齑盐亦阙供。\n正可清言学夷甫，不须豪气似元龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4826,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂书四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"身似匡庐老病僧，闭门一衲坐腾腾。\n雨声惊断长安梦，惆怅西窗夜半灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4827,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂书四首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"枳篱莎径入荆扉，中有村翁百结衣。\n谁识新年欢喜事，一鸡一犬伴东归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4828,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴四首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"庖丁悟养生，轮扁议读书。\n彼特一技尔，圣智有不如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4829,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴十首 其八","author":"陆游","text":"犀象本安山海远，楩楠岂愿栋梁材。\n伏波病困壶头日，应有严光入梦来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4830,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴三首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"古寺高楼暮倚阑，野云不散白漫漫。\n好山遮尽君无恨，且作沧溟万里看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4831,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴四首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"寸阴可惜子所知，尺宅治生今未迟。\n虚费年光作闲事，人间信有白头痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4832,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴十首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"赤米熟炊元自软，黄齑频倒不多酸。\n纵令酒负寻常债，也胜人求本分官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4833,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴四首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"一春妍暖无多日，八十康强有几人。\n学不名家空自苦，路边醉倒却关身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4834,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"清霜染丹叶，秋晚粲如春。\n回首风吹尽，天公解戏人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4835,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴十首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"早遇齐侯游柏寝，晚从汉帝祀甘泉。\n不须苦学飞腾术，更看泥金检玉年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4836,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴三首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"孤梦初回揭短篷，桥边晓日已曈昽。\n太平气象君知否，尽在丰年笑语中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4837,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴十首 其七","author":"陆游","text":"扁舟夜载石帆月，双屦晓穿天柱云。\n八十老翁能办此，不须身将渡辽军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4838,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"蛟鳄垂涎历畏涂，如今欢喜去携锄。\n一生患难休回首，疋似元符曾上书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4839,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴四首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"诗人肝肺困雕镌，往往寿非金石坚。\n我独适情无杰句，化工不忌遣长年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4840,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴四首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"暮年常苦睡为祟，好事新分安乐茶。\n更得小瓢吾事足，山家风味似僧家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4841,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴四首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"病养精神过服药，贫知俭约胜营生。\n皋夔事业今何有，且与心君致太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4842,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]